                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ok, If you are thinking of buying this \"Game\", Go outside, find the first stick you see. That will be more fun to play with than this game...\n\nThis is not a game, it is a cryengine map.\n\nThe only plus of it, is that cryengine allows the forest in the middle to look somewhat nice if you ignore the floating grass that is around.\n\nAll the game consists of, is walking around a dull maze, finding 8 pressure plates, and then finding the exit.\n\nYou are even able to just fly around the map if you press f4 to go into flymode (Intended for developer use)\n\nI bought this game because i enjoyed maze runner, and thought i'd give it a shot.\n\nBut seriously, dont buy this game in its current state. It is a waste of both money and hard drive space. (4.5 Gig for this? Wow)",
